<!doctype lake><title>企业用户对接SOP</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="fixed" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><p data-lake-id="u164510b3" id="u164510b3" style="text-align: left"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua96822c3" id="ua96822c3" class="lake-fontsize-16">​</span></strong><br></p><table data-lake-id="tlZEN" id="tlZEN" margin="true" width-mode="contain" class="lake-table" style="width: 750px"><colgroup><col width="250"><col width="250"><col width="250"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id="u1e90a992" id="u1e90a992"><td data-lake-id="u37247a91" id="u37247a91"><p data-lake-id="u4cad3e1b" id="u4cad3e1b"><span data-lake-id="u4de744b5" id="u4de744b5">编写时间</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u40460e12" id="u40460e12"><p data-lake-id="u21ee6fb8" id="u21ee6fb8"><span data-lake-id="ua82b7954" id="ua82b7954">负责人</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u287cdec2" id="u287cdec2"><p data-lake-id="u076aa151" id="u076aa151"><span data-lake-id="u70f5ec9f" id="u70f5ec9f">备注</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u5767c718" id="u5767c718"><td data-lake-id="uca02e890" id="uca02e890"><p data-lake-id="u40634ad4" id="u40634ad4"><span data-lake-id="uf0011b5e" id="uf0011b5e">2026年4月16日</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u4c61dd7e" id="u4c61dd7e"><p data-lake-id="u2846e839" id="u2846e839"><span data-lake-id="u4fc0dde0" id="u4fc0dde0">陈飞</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="uca0cd9a9" id="uca0cd9a9"><p data-lake-id="uec15c788" id="uec15c788"><span data-lake-id="uafd63e89" id="uafd63e89">2.0版本</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id="u8404e55c" id="u8404e55c"><td data-lake-id="u00b4d2e2" id="u00b4d2e2"><p data-lake-id="u715b30ec" id="u715b30ec"><span data-lake-id="u19f874d4" id="u19f874d4">2026年2月28日</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="ue4db8345" id="ue4db8345"><p data-lake-id="u49788624" id="u49788624"><span data-lake-id="u478d6a1b" id="u478d6a1b">陈飞</span></p></td><td data-lake-id="u55dc5f56" id="u55dc5f56"><p data-lake-id="u41129063" id="u41129063"><span data-lake-id="u0aaca942" id="u0aaca942">1.0版本</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p data-lake-id="u587b8c16" id="u587b8c16" style="text-align: center"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9db5ea13" id="u9db5ea13" class="lake-fontsize-16">​</span></strong><br></p><p data-lake-id="ufe34a6a8" id="ufe34a6a8" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u2d2902f9" id="u2d2902f9" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u46275e47" id="u46275e47" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4c556f29" id="u4c556f29" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.1</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="uf177ff73" id="uf177ff73" class="lake-fontsize-16">对接沟通合作</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u70e0db7e" id="u70e0db7e" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u02426ea9" id="u02426ea9" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业用户添加好友</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8cd05795" id="u8cd05795" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u28f388d8" id="u28f388d8" class="lake-fontsize-12">先沟通需求，明确企业权益</span></p><p data-lake-id="u82ab24b2" id="u82ab24b2" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u520a1196" id="u520a1196" class="lake-fontsize-12">确认后走开通流程</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0e096cfb" id="u0e096cfb" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uf0e1c52a" id="uf0e1c52a" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u3fdd2822" id="u3fdd2822" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u6f0f9564" id="u6f0f9564" class="lake-fontsize-12">确认需求话术：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u10f1e69f" id="u10f1e69f" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u53477b19" id="u53477b19" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">您好，请问您那边团队大概多少人要用？主要用什么模型哈？月用量大概多少哈？</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u1a521aab" id="u1a521aab" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ud0659a2d" id="ud0659a2d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">我们这边支持</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ucb3a005f" id="ucb3a005f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">Claude</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ufda98412" id="ufda98412" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u1001bcdd" id="u1001bcdd" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">Codex</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u9f318c2a" id="u9f318c2a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u427ae49c" id="u427ae49c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">Gemini</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uadf6604d" id="uadf6604d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">最新的模型；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u7d420236" id="u7d420236" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u732ca67b" id="u732ca67b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">除了</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ue3402417" id="ue3402417" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">cli</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ue8c4fb73" id="ue8c4fb73" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">终端直接使用，也支持</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u7c0689ac" id="u7c0689ac" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">api</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u2f66797d" id="u2f66797d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">的调用；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uf748cbcc" id="uf748cbcc" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ucb8c11b6" id="ucb8c11b6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">目前市场热门工具，我们也是支持的，比如</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u8db2e62d" id="u8db2e62d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">OpenClaw </span></em><em><span data-lake-id="udfbe2f91" id="udfbe2f91" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u5da1f2ca" id="u5da1f2ca" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">OpenCode</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u02ffae18" id="u02ffae18" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ue4b67ad0" id="ue4b67ad0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">Cline</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uac634188" id="uac634188" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ufd6a0210" id="ufd6a0210" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">CherryStudio</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u7460bdfc" id="u7460bdfc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">等；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u61b8d363" id="u61b8d363" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uf9e4de2f" id="uf9e4de2f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">官网有详细的教程和配置指南，需要我给您发哈。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="ub25d3879" id="ub25d3879" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf125aeb1" id="uf125aeb1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u62e90ff5" id="u62e90ff5" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业认证权益话术：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u69748033" id="u69748033" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u4d56a388" id="u4d56a388" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">企业认证 200元/月（不含额度），权益如下：</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u51e40d3e" id="u51e40d3e" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uc197eb31" id="uc197eb31" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">1</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u8904b65d" id="u8904b65d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、所有</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ub2638637" id="ub2638637" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">Apikey</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u3d9bd6a5" id="u3d9bd6a5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">相关的增值功能，包括多创建（</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u60c2e226" id="u60c2e226" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">100</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u0245fa65" id="u0245fa65" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">个</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u46488e90" id="u46488e90" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">key</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ua3eb3d63" id="ua3eb3d63" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">），按</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u5e32cf10" id="u5e32cf10" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">apikey</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u6125b234" id="u6125b234" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">限量，按</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u7530e991" id="u7530e991" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">apikey</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uf94b096b" id="uf94b096b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">查询等；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="ua12bd029" id="ua12bd029" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u3b279e2f" id="u3b279e2f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">2</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u767278d6" id="u767278d6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、优先保障速率，支持高并发；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u469d6fc5" id="u469d6fc5" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u2df2e570" id="u2df2e570" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">3</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ub2661a23" id="ub2661a23" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、支持对公转账、支持开票，优先享受活动权益；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u227dea5e" id="u227dea5e" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ubc7197c9" id="ubc7197c9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">4</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ua9315990" id="ua9315990" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">、按量付费阶梯折扣：</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uc036e556" id="uc036e556" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u49583a7c" id="u49583a7c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ud2fbe061" id="ud2fbe061" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">累计充值超过</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u6b800299" id="u6b800299" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">2000</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uf225873e" id="uf225873e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">元但不足</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ua4273d62" id="ua4273d62" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">5000</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u82bf3da2" id="u82bf3da2" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">元，按量</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u3010e5a4" id="u3010e5a4" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">85</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ub01c0a8f" id="ub01c0a8f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">折；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u740dbce9" id="u740dbce9" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u39909235" id="u39909235" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u1aa8383d" id="u1aa8383d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">累计充值超过</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uab34f5f6" id="uab34f5f6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">5000</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ue14d0efa" id="ue14d0efa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">元但不足</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u0ce655b1" id="u0ce655b1" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">10000</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u24a5662b" id="u24a5662b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">元，按量</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ue0b271af" id="ue0b271af" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">80</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uf484e354" id="uf484e354" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">折，</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u810205b3" id="u810205b3" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uf405881c" id="uf405881c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">累计充值超过10000元，按量75折，</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u786acedf" id="u786acedf" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ue591607e" id="ue591607e" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ua652c3e2" id="ua652c3e2" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u109fe6c2" id="u109fe6c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">确认开通话术：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u33bfc3f6" id="u33bfc3f6" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u849a1e07" id="u849a1e07" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">麻烦您缴纳增值服务费200/月，然后给我您的企业名称，企业主账号（注册手机号），我为您建立专属企业服务。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u76679ca9" id="u76679ca9" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ub5d16e62" id="ub5d16e62" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9aee94ed" id="u9aee94ed" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c728dae" id="u0c728dae" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.2</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u786b8ff9" id="u786b8ff9" class="lake-fontsize-16">登记企业信息开通</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uada59ecc" id="uada59ecc" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uf1ed1346" id="uf1ed1346" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1</span><span data-lake-id="udce5eb9a" id="udce5eb9a" class="lake-fontsize-12">：对接客服登录语雀，登记企业认证信息；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7e529297" id="u7e529297" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uaf3d34eb" id="uaf3d34eb" class="lake-fontsize-12">            https://furbox.yuque.com/org-wiki-furbox-spmbkw/oishf7/feclilgd9t7nwpvy#VdST</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud33772eb" id="ud33772eb" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ubaebc25d" id="ubaebc25d" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2：值班客服在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb56756d" id="ubb56756d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">【AICodeMirror】客服大群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uae55fa43" id="uae55fa43" class="lake-fontsize-12">，发送申请开通企业用户</span></p><p data-lake-id="u61ad7b21" id="u61ad7b21" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u0aae4856" id="u0aae4856" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step3</span><span data-lake-id="u575d9953" id="u575d9953" class="lake-fontsize-12">：开通后，值班客服需发消息给用户，告知开通；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u902eea6f" id="u902eea6f" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ue61ce372" id="ue61ce372" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf867c579" id="uf867c579" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u69aa817e" id="u69aa817e" class="lake-fontsize-12">话术如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u22777ed2" id="u22777ed2" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u3f52a26f" id="u3f52a26f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">广州伊的家网络科技有限公司        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="ub86708ef" id="ub86708ef" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u65373da8" id="u65373da8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">18122306015</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u3232e546" id="u3232e546" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">                </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="ue1acb973" id="ue1acb973" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ue96d021c" id="ue96d021c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">支付宝转账</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u865687c0" id="u865687c0" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">200</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u142c05e6" id="u142c05e6" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u6b293dd1" id="u6b293dd1" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u2244c762" id="u2244c762" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">到期</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="ucbcce567" id="ucbcce567" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">03/28 @</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u4040e930" id="u4040e930" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">杰哥</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u1f37494a" id="u1f37494a" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u2b6e800c" id="u2b6e800c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">附支付截图；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u475c8b25" id="u475c8b25" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u996b618f" id="u996b618f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u173818b9" id="u173818b9" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u04ccdac9" id="u04ccdac9" class="lake-fontsize-12">