22y%22%3A300%2C%22width%22%3A291%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%E5%90%8E%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%8F%AF%E5%9C%A8%E9%92%B1%E5%8C%85%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E5%8F%91%E7%A5%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B7%E5%85%A5%E5%8F%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A230%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%222026%2F06%2F1613%3A39%22%2C%22x%22%3A32%2C%22y%22%3A230%2C%22width%22%3A134%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%91%E7%A5%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B7%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%3A%E5%B7%B2%E5%BC%80%E5%90%AF%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A81%2C%22width%22%3A126%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%91%E7%A5%A8%E5%BC%80%E5%85%B7%E6%9D%83%E9%99%90%22%2C%22x%22%3A73%2C%22y%22%3A331%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%8C%89%E9%87%8F%E4%BB%98%E8%B4%B9%E4%B8%93%E4%BA%AB%E6%8A%98%E6%89%A3%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A275%2C%22width%22%3A113%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8E%86%E5%8F%B2%E5%85%85%E5%80%BC%3A%EF%BF%A510.00%22%2C%22x%22%3A15%2C%22y%22%3A62%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2213311097589%22%2C%22x%22%3A19%2C%22y%22%3A14%2C%22width%22%3A85%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A153%2C%22width%22%3A63%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E6%96%B0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A17%2C%22y%22%3A114%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%88%B0%E6%9C%9F%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22x%22%3A18%2C%22y%22%3A196%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IP%3AIP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A121%2C%22y%22%3A38%2C%22width%22%3A72%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22IP1%22%2C%22x%22%3A72%2C%22y%22%3A39%2C%22width%22%3A61%2C%22height%22%3A11%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23232e3f%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5a25117b%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u317cd4a9" id="u317cd4a9" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ua395eb38" id="ua395eb38">注意：如果用户选择返现，择必须关闭按量付费专享折扣</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua1faabff" id="ua1faabff" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uac3fd4d7" id="uac3fd4d7">step4：在企业面板页面，输入手机号，查询到企业后，点击【编辑】，修改账户名为企业名称</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua2bcddbb" id="ua2bcddbb" style="text-align: justify"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1778910156016-3521d63e-de8b-4320-bcc1-66b489d78714.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ub94d4510-1e96-4f8c-bfc2-c6663bba1a2%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u729e716a-3bc9-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A531%2C%22height%22%3A405%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A27576%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A531%2C%22originHeight%22%3A405%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8E%BB%E9%99%A4%E9%A6%96%E5%B0%BE%E7%A9%BA%E6%A0%BC%E5%90%8E%E4%B8%8D%E8%83%BD%E4%B8%BA%E7%A9%BA%2C%E4%B8%94%E6%9C%80%E5%A4%9A100%E4%B8%AA%E5%AD%97%E7%AC%A6.%22%2C%22x%22%3A35%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A249%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BB%92%E7%9B%92%E5%AD%90(%E5%8C%97%E4%BA%AC%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A232%2C%22width%22%3A196%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A34%2C%22y%22%3A32%2C%22width%22%3A101%2C%22height%22%3A23%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E7%94%A8%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%3A%E9%99%88%E9%A3%9E%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A136%2C%22width%22%3A116%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%B4%A6%E6%88%B7%E5%90%8D%22%2C%22x%22%3A33%2C%22y%22%3A194%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2214100%22%2C%22x%22%3A460%2C%22y%22%3A272%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%22%2C%22x%22%3A455%2C%22y%22%3A43%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A451%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%8F%96%E6%B6%88%22%2C%22x%22%3A378%2C%22y%22%3A345%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%231d2736%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ueb00935d%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u006498ad" id="u006498ad" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ua182453a" id="ua182453a">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u61d1a55b" id="u61d1a55b" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u6112f50a" id="u6112f50a">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9c3862c4" id="u9c3862c4" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u1fedeef3" id="u1fedeef3">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u065917ac" id="u065917ac" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0802dba9" id="u0802dba9" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.3</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d853567" id="u8d853567" class="lake-fontsize-16">创建企业服务群</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u657b66e7" id="u657b66e7" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uc1b4b12f" id="uc1b4b12f" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1：企业微信【工作台】--【创建一个用户群】--使用模版快速配置群，选择</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u66a44d00" id="u66a44d00" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业合作群模版</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u587e7469" id="u587e7469" class="lake-fontsize-12">；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u92002fae" id="u92002fae" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u56ef042d" id="u56ef042d" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2：修改群名称为【</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a7926de" id="u8a7926de" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业名称缩写&amp;AICodeMirror</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue394cd0a" id="ue394cd0a" class="lake-fontsize-12">】；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u003f85dd" id="u003f85dd" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u00cb2f1f" id="u00cb2f1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step3</span><span data-lake-id="uf497b2c0" id="uf497b2c0" class="lake-fontsize-12">：拉内部人员进群（鹤杰、张嘉祥、技术客服）；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubabb927b" id="ubabb927b" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ua2c8336e" id="ua2c8336e" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step4</span><span data-lake-id="ud8295a1c" id="ud8295a1c" class="lake-fontsize-12">：拉企业用户进群；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u6b5cf298" id="u6b5cf298" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u4f51d96b" id="u4f51d96b" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step5</span><span data-lake-id="ue42cf839" id="ue42cf839" class="lake-fontsize-12">：在群里</span><span data-lake-id="u047a5dfe" id="u047a5dfe" class="lake-fontsize-12">@</span><span data-lake-id="ub91d0295" id="ub91d0295" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业用户：</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc66fbd4a" id="uc66fbd4a" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u5c978d7c" id="u5c978d7c" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">您好，这是咱们的企业合作群，后续您有任何需要，都可以在群里@我或者我同事，我们会第一时间为您提供支持；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u957e04a1" id="u957e04a1" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u8f834356" id="u8f834356" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u79796713" id="u79796713" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud2525986" id="ud2525986" class="lake-fontsize-12">check list </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u750acaf7" id="u750acaf7" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uc7ff4e9b" id="uc7ff4e9b" class="lake-fontsize-12">1、确认群名符合规范</span></p><p data-lake-id="ucfb17a81" id="ucfb17a81" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ufd85fe57" id="ufd85fe57" class="lake-fontsize-12">2、确认必要人员已进群</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud79cbb71" id="ud79cbb71" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u2267a33c" id="u2267a33c" class="lake-fontsize-12">3、确认企业用户知悉企业群</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7c186495" id="u7c186495" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ub41fb51d" id="ub41fb51d" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u8eae7892" id="u8eae7892" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9ef51f2" id="ua9ef51f2" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.4</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue2864bc5" id="ue2864bc5" class="lake-fontsize-16">企业缴费充值</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue767628c" id="ue767628c" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5ae16500" id="u5ae16500" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ud0f9ac15" id="ud0f9ac15" class="lake-fontsize-12">支持网站直接充值；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0d495289" id="u0d495289" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ubdfaa247" id="ubdfaa247" class="lake-fontsize-12">支持对公转账；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u97e317bd" id="u97e317bd" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u5f1d6bda" id="u5f1d6bda" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5509f0d1" id="u5509f0d1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uf675fb36" id="uf675fb36" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1：企业用户将缴费信息，发</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u436a3f03" id="u436a3f03" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业合作群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7df5dac1" id="u7df5dac1" class="lake-fontsize-12">；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u08f7efcd" id="u08f7efcd" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u6fa5fafd" id="u6fa5fafd" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2：值班客服在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc58cf0ee" id="uc58cf0ee" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业合作群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4113977c" id="u4113977c" class="lake-fontsize-12">，要求对方提供支付截图或者对公转账支付凭证</span></p><p data-lake-id="u10666637" id="u10666637" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uc0eb3e77" id="uc0eb3e77" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step3：值班客服登记需补齐额度信息到语雀；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0d3e860b" id="u0d3e860b" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u1647626b" id="u1647626b" class="lake-fontsize-12">            https://furbox.yuque.com/org-wiki-furbox-spmbkw/oishf7/smb6ahlaks93gosg#FY6u</span></p><p data-lake-id="uae77ee53" id="uae77ee53" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uc257703c" id="uc257703c" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step4：发补齐额度信息到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ubbe21500" id="ubbe21500" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">【AICodeMirror】客服大群 </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8793a05b" id="u8793a05b" class="lake-fontsize-12">公示留存，</span></p><p data-lake-id="u25d60a1c" id="u25d60a1c" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ub3d6f144" id="ub3d6f144" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step5：阿飞补齐额度操作完成后，企业合作群@用户，请用户确认额度无误；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua7884368" id="ua7884368" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u822c75dd" id="u822c75dd" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：网站直接充值，自动补齐额度；对公转账需要登记后人工补齐额度；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue512f70c" id="ue512f70c" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u18c55bc0" id="u18c55bc0" class="lake-fontsize-12">话术如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u18a8f2ce" id="u18a8f2ce" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u6877e6b9" id="u6877e6b9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">美夏国际贸易（上海）有限公司        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u84e8ad86" id="u84e8ad86" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ue4b1557a" id="ue4b1557a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">16601114055</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u4f4e0a4f" id="u4f4e0a4f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="ue00f2f93" id="ue00f2f93" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uc21ce84a" id="uc21ce84a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">2100</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u55f5858f" id="u55f5858f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u762dcf57" id="u762dcf57" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u10aef2ab" id="u10aef2ab" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">70</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u27772daf" id="u27772daf" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">        </span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u2c3a33a1" id="u2c3a33a1" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u166c4490" id="u166c4490" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">对公转账 @杰哥</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="uffe1f0f8" id="uffe1f0f8" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ua0872284" id="ua0872284" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">附用户充值记录证明信息（支付凭证）</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u58dea7a5" id="u58dea7a5" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u5c257e97" id="u5c257e97" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u143ccecd" id="u143ccecd" class="lake-fontsize-12">补齐额度操作如下</span></p><p data-lake-id="ubfeae632" id="ubfeae632" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u966f53fb" id="u966f53fb" class="lake-fontsize-12">step1  打开管理后台，查询到用户信息</span></p><p data-lake-id="u866dcef9" id="u866dcef9" style="text-align: justify"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1779159829111-e8b13510-4a2d-497a-8dbb-fb4a7f4d2639.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uc41b8c5f-55fe-485a-bd19-40b647e1785%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u36b34e47-5dfe-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A1568%2C%22height%22%3A401%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A60651%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1568%2C%22originHeight%22%3A401%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2