%E9%87%91%E9%A2%9D%22%2C%22x%22%3A57%2C%22y%22%3A321%2C%22width%22%3A77%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E4%BF%AE%E6%94%B9%22%2C%22x%22%3A177%2C%22y%22%3A521%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%AF%B7%E4%BB%94%E7%BB%86%E6%A0%B8%E5%AF%B9%3A%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A429%2C%22width%22%3A70%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%231f2b3a%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ua2596ccb%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u871d35d5" id="u871d35d5" style="text-align: justify"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F523194%2F1779159971332-e88188f2-d2ad-4585-a6c8-6815b8d3be87.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u664d8d0b-4cbf-43c4-8354-2e25b635822%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u36b34e47-5dfe-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A960%2C%22height%22%3A63%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A11350%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A960%2C%22originHeight%22%3A63%2C%22ratio%22%3A1%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%3A%E4%B8%8A%E6%B5%B7%E8%BF%9E%E9%9A%90%E7%BD%91%E7%BB%9C%E7%A7%91%E6%8A%80%E9%9B%86%E5%9B%A2%E6%9C%89%E9%99%90%E5%85%AC%E5%8F%B8%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A17%2C%22width%22%3A181%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2275%E5%AF%B9%E5%85%AC%E8%BD%AC%E8%B4%A6%22%2C%22x%22%3A550%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A100%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A415%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A93%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2213115790750%22%2C%22x%22%3A308%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A78%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OOOOOOOTOOOOOOAAAAAAAAAAOOOOO%22%2C%22x%22%3A537%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A174%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22N%22%2C%22x%22%3A242%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A104%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2230000%22%2C%22x%22%3A426%2C%22y%22%3A20%2C%22width%22%3A87%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2240000%22%2C%22x%22%3A864%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A39%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f7f7f7%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub3428c13%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9fdcc204" id="u9fdcc204" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uaf1519e4" id="uaf1519e4" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u57cfd966" id="u57cfd966" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u255009e2" id="u255009e2" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubfec941b" id="ubfec941b" class="lake-fontsize-12">check list </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u830a85fb" id="u830a85fb" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ub14c14a4" id="ub14c14a4" class="lake-fontsize-12">1、确认支付凭证金额、补齐额度登记金额一致；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua4e114fa" id="ua4e114fa" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u455fcc54" id="u455fcc54" class="lake-fontsize-12">2、确认补齐额度折扣无误</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8bf66548" id="u8bf66548" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u0928895c" id="u0928895c" class="lake-fontsize-12">3、补齐额度后一定要让用户确认无误</span></p><p data-lake-id="u66c5b6e0" id="u66c5b6e0" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="ua912d327" id="ua912d327" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ae6c1ea" id="u0ae6c1ea" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.5</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u0bfd2055" id="u0bfd2055" class="lake-fontsize-16">企业开票</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5b9e9732" id="u5b9e9732" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u2a0a7ee9" id="u2a0a7ee9" class="lake-fontsize-12">正常开票</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf06a82b1" id="uf06a82b1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u874b19f4" id="u874b19f4" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1：无论什么充值方式，告知用户选择网站自助开票；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u062d21cf" id="u062d21cf" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u09152078" id="u09152078" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2：对公转账生成的记录，需要人工补上开票主体；</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf5185eb2" id="uf5185eb2" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u7703f691" id="u7703f691" class="lake-fontsize-12">在每周一每周四，开票前：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u61bfacbd" id="u61bfacbd" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u733ee477" id="u733ee477" class="lake-fontsize-12">查询订单号为 【 ADMIN_RECHARGE】 开头的 发票提交信息：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u412360c1" id="u412360c1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u2384c0d3" id="u2384c0d3" class="lake-fontsize-12">上传对公转账截图，</span></p><p data-lake-id="u44580597" id="u44580597" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uf21f43fd" id="uf21f43fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">同时根据收款主体，明确开票主体。</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud8e98b55" id="ud8e98b55" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ua09f3971" id="ua09f3971" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u16184812" id="u16184812" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8e894227" id="u8e894227" class="lake-fontsize-12">如需要先开票后打款，需先确认收到发票后打款时间。</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue222669e" id="ue222669e" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u7b5e3c93" id="u7b5e3c93" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1：对接客服，转发企业需求，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u720380bf" id="u720380bf" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">【AICodeMirror】客服大群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub3ec4120" id="ub3ec4120" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #DF2A3F"> </span><span data-lake-id="uc0b79b34" id="uc0b79b34" class="lake-fontsize-12">确认后，进行开票；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue5e26590" id="ue5e26590" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ue732be02" id="ue732be02" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2</span><span data-lake-id="u5db80222" id="u5db80222" class="lake-fontsize-12">：对接客服，需登记开票信息到语雀；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u05751219" id="u05751219" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u98c9e990" id="u98c9e990" class="lake-fontsize-12">            https://furbox.yuque.com/org-wiki-furbox-spmbkw/oishf7/yhys33amgocfem2i#cLya</span></p><p data-lake-id="u20c04ea6" id="u20c04ea6" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="udde3a04f" id="udde3a04f" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step3：对接客服，将开票信息发</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e1db9f1" id="u2e1db9f1" class="lake-fontsize-12">【AICodeMirror】客服大群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5c9be4b8" id="u5c9be4b8" class="lake-fontsize-12">告知杰哥；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u8640a56f" id="u8640a56f" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u328071a1" id="u328071a1" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step4</span><span data-lake-id="u2c7d14e3" id="u2c7d14e3" class="lake-fontsize-12">：根据预计打款时间，联系用户确认打款事宜；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub7edcb11" id="ub7edcb11" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u698f4174" id="u698f4174" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u9c4885d9" id="u9c4885d9" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0fad60ce" id="u0fad60ce" class="lake-fontsize-12">check list </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf9ead27e" id="uf9ead27e" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u3d84c040" id="u3d84c040" class="lake-fontsize-12">1、确认开票主题，有合同走毛绒盒子开票；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u80b96963" id="u80b96963" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u053ef2a7" id="u053ef2a7" class="lake-fontsize-12">2、确认企业需求专票还是普票</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub44aad97" id="ub44aad97" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u07001e2a" id="u07001e2a" class="lake-fontsize-12">3、确认开票金额无误</span></p><p data-lake-id="uaf55f714" id="uaf55f714" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u9ae6c289" id="u9ae6c289" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="ub0182eef" id="ub0182eef" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue0b90de9" id="ue0b90de9" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.6</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ue61ab53a" id="ue61ab53a" class="lake-fontsize-16">企业需要走合同</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uc3a8c13a" id="uc3a8c13a" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u62734850" id="u62734850" class="lake-fontsize-12">如果企业用户提出需要走合同，</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1bae5838" id="u1bae5838" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u48910dbc" id="u48910dbc" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step1</span><span data-lake-id="u63e7d52e" id="u63e7d52e" class="lake-fontsize-12">：给用户发【合同范本】；</span></p><p data-lake-id="ud015fbec" id="ud015fbec" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ub237a386" id="ub237a386" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step2</span><span data-lake-id="ue2ee3c62" id="ue2ee3c62" class="lake-fontsize-12">：等待对方法务确认，用【修订】模式修改；</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf3b21534" id="uf3b21534" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u66a0cd67" id="u66a0cd67" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step3：将对方修改后合同，转到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8925d56e" id="u8925d56e" class="lake-fontsize-12">【AICodeMirror】客服大群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uebe43ba1" id="uebe43ba1" class="lake-fontsize-12">，让杰哥确认；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u28463986" id="u28463986" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u365f7ebf" id="u365f7ebf" class="lake-fontsize-12">Step4：双方修改确认无误后，发到</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3769cfc2" id="u3769cfc2" class="lake-fontsize-12">【AICodeMirror】客服大群</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u27e972fd" id="u27e972fd" class="lake-fontsize-12">，申请盖章；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3c33b334" id="u3c33b334" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="udb48c3c9" id="udb48c3c9" class="lake-fontsize-12">注意：如需电子版直接盖章发送；如需纸质盖章，要邮递地址；</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc6ec3906" id="uc6ec3906" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u75ae0dd3" id="u75ae0dd3" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf2500a26" id="uf2500a26" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">1.7</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="ub8f3e382" id="ub8f3e382" class="lake-fontsize-16">定期检查企业认证到期时间</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u0a22d39f" id="u0a22d39f" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u57c3d864" id="u57c3d864" class="lake-fontsize-12">企业认证开通后，定时检查企业认证时间，提前一周左右，告知企业用户即将到期，请续费。</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0dc70fd6" id="u0dc70fd6" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u3f3883ed" id="u3f3883ed" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ub10d418a" id="ub10d418a" class="lake-fontsize-12">附录：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u92727817" id="u92727817" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u6e2d7c40" id="u6e2d7c40" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1、初次沟通企业用户使用场景和具体需求</span></p><p data-lake-id="udaeb0c43" id="udaeb0c43" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u991d40fc" id="u991d40fc" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">团体适用人数、主要用什么模型，使用场景是什么？</span></p><p data-lake-id="ue386ce8f" id="ue386ce8f" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uef01b68e" id="uef01b68e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">注意：如果团体人数超过5人，可以送一个月，先开通企业账户，让用户体验；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u2d61b75b" id="u2d61b75b" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uf85108c2" id="uf85108c2" class="lake-fontsize-12">          企业用户开通后，走网站充值，默认享受活动折扣；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u11a1e0c1" id="u11a1e0c1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u9eb9f1d7" id="u9eb9f1d7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2、有什么要求，比如企业按量付费折扣、key的管控、对公转账、开专票等；</span></p><p data-lake-id="uafaabd98" id="uafaabd98" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ub157854f" id="ub157854f" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3、语音通话，可告知企业折扣补齐，额度可以提现（50%）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u0e9f21b9" id="u0e9f21b9" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="uf0e88c2b" id="uf0e88c2b" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u5e223700" id="u5e223700" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">认证企业回访</span></p><p data-lake-id="ufcecdb3e" id="ufcecdb3e" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u115c3aaa" id="u115c3aaa" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">1、认证到期前一周，即时回访</span></p><p data-lake-id="uab066dbe" id="uab066dbe" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u5de93b1d" id="u5de93b1d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">回访目的：确认是否续费，是否有不满意的地方；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u54127273" id="u54127273" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u5fe7046b" id="u5fe7046b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2、余额不足1000，即时回访</span></p><p data-lake-id="u7f83ed10" id="u7f83ed10" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u36ea12c5" id="u36ea12c5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">回访目的：提醒充值、活动折扣告知等；</span></p><p data-lake-id="uc04f7fc8" id="uc04f7fc8" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u38eaa6ee" id="u38eaa6ee" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3、累计消费较高（超5万），间歇性回访</span></p><p data-lake-id="uad99640f" id="uad99640f" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u418dfd84" id="u418dfd84" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">回访目的：了解企业使用情况，是否有更多需求？功能建议收集；</span></p><p data-lake-id="u4b190245" id="u4b190245" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ue4578cc7" id="ue4578cc7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u76634a82" id="u76634a82" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u04ada6c7" id="u04ada6c7" class="lake-fontsize-12">话术如下：</span></p><p data-lake-id="u86ae88e7" id="u86ae88e7" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uca0a97f7" id="uca0a97f7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">您好，企业认证快到期了哦，服务费您看还续交吗？</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u9328d943" id="u9328d943" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u14ba70ee" id="u14ba70ee" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">需要的话，我给您支付宝收款码；您直接根据需要续的月份转账即可。（</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="u282a860d" id="u282a860d" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">200/</span></em><em><span data-lake-id="uf29c77c7" id="uf29c77c7" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">每月）</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u7324e887" id="u7324e887" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u4a8047f5" id="u4a8047f5" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">或者您也可以在下次充值时一起办理；</span></em></p><p data-lake-id="u7c07d2dc" id="u7c07d2dc" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u9a06ea67" id="u9a06ea67" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u4c7e17e2" id="u4c7e17e2" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="u46987ab9" id="u46987ab9" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u679e306d" id="u679e306d" style="text-align: justify"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3fdbf1bf" id="u3fdbf1bf" class="lake-fontsize-16" style="color: black">关于合同审核部分</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u5e2002a1" id="u5e2002a1" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uc5ebff7e" id="uc5ebff7e" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u16d32f28" id="u16d32f28" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u0c1ac0d8" id="u0c1ac0d8" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000"> 1、企业信息所有x都要补充完整 </span></p><p data-lake-id="ue6258d06" id="ue6258d06" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ua6114244" id="ua6114244" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">2、修订部分是否有不利于我们的地方</span></p><p data-lake-id="ub26cf5c4" id="ub26cf5c4" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="uffd2f609" id="uffd2f609" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #000000">3、重点涉及到赔偿地方都必须用20%上限覆盖。  </span></p><p data-lake-id="uc96e83c7" id="uc96e83c7" style="text-align: justify"><br></p><p data-lake-id="u4a0fc3fc" id="u4a0fc3fc" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="ud5cedb1a" id="ud5cedb1a" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="u544e2526" id="u544e2526" style="text-align: justify"><em><span data-lake-id="uff661a1b" id="uff661a1b" class="lake-fontsize-12" style="color: #2F4BDA">​</span></em><br></p><p data-lake-id="udcafbbcc" id="udcafbbcc" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="u502a66ca" id="u502a66ca" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p><p data-lake-id="u152170fe" id="u152170fe" style="text-align: justify"><span data-lake-id="ud6889a1f" id="ud6889a1f" class="lake-fontsize-12">​</span><br></p>